                      Assigns New Opportunity Support Requests to Opportunity Support Queue
                      Assigns New Proposal Management Requests to Proposal Service Queue
                      Assigns New Proposal Requests to Opportunity Support Queue
Email Alert: New Record Created
                   GCCS Queue Notification (Only for Global commercial Support Requests)
Merged with the Create commercial request Flow
(Please refer to the gitlab user story #18103 for more details)

